  order: 2
---
The **Import Leads** feature allows you to upload multiple leads at once using a CSV file. This is useful for migrating data, importing leads from other tools, or bulk-adding prospects into your system.

## Overview

Instead of creating leads one by one, you can:

- Upload a CSV file
- Map fields to the system
- Import all leads in bulk

Once imported, leads will automatically appear in the Leads module.

## Navigation

To access the import feature:

1. Go to **Leads**
1. Click the **+ (Plus icon)** next to the **Create Lead** button
1. Select **Import**
1. You will be redirected to:\
   **Settings → Data Management**

## Download Sample CSV

Before uploading your file:

1. Go to **Import**
1. Select **Exports**
1. Download the **Sample CSV**

This file contains the correct format and field structure required for successful import.

## Prepare Your CSV File

Ensure your CSV includes relevant columns such as:

- First Name
- Last Name
- Email
- Phone
- Company Name
- Website
- Status
- Currency
- Lead Value
- Lead Source
- Last Interaction Date
- Lead Owner
- Country
- State
- City
- Zip Code
- Description

## Upload CSV File

1. In the Import section:
   - Drag and drop your CSV file into the upload area\
     **or**
   - Click to browse and select your file
1. Once selected, the system will process the file for mapping

## Field Mapping

After uploading:

- Match each **CSV column** to the corresponding **system field**
- Ensure all required fields are correctly mapped

### Example:

- CSV “email” → System “Email”
- CSV “first_name” → System “First Name”

## Start Import

1. Click the **Import** button
1. The system will begin processing your data

## System Notification

After starting the import, you will see:

- **Notification Message:**
  - *“Import started. Records will appear in the system shortly.”*
- A notification bar may also display:
  - *“Import started, records will appear shortly”*

## Import Processing

- The import runs in the background
- Processing time depends on file size
- You can continue using the system during import

## Completion

Once the import is complete:

- All valid records will be added to the **Leads module**
- You can view them in the Leads list
- Imported leads will follow standard system behavior:
  - Editable
  - Assignable
  - Convertible to deals

## Best Practices

- Always use the **Sample CSV format**
- Ensure emails are valid and unique
- Avoid duplicate entries
- Map fields carefully before importing
- Start with a small test file if importing large datasets

## Troubleshooting

**Issue: Data not appearing**

- Wait a few moments for background processing
- Refresh the Leads page

**Issue: Incorrect data mapping**

- Re-import with correct field mapping

**Issue: Missing fields**

- Ensure required fields are included in CSV
